# Build context allow-list for src/ui/Dockerfile (BuildKit uses this file instead
# of the root .dockerignore). Everything is excluded except the UI code and its
# requirements, so data, models, photos and .env can never enter the UI image (RISK-06).
*
!requirements-ui.txt
!src/__init__.py
!src/ui/
src/ui/**/__pycache__
src/ui/Dockerfile*
